  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759920,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 17-Bit Software PD Catalogue - Commodore Amiga\n\nStep into the vibrant, pixelated world of 17-Bit Software PD Catalogue, a charming and nostalgic journey through the golden age of shareware gaming on the Commodore Amiga! This isn't a single game, but a curated collection of six unique, fully-playable shareware titles from 17-Bit Software, meticulously preserved and presented for a new generation of Amiga enthusiasts.\n\nExperience the thrill of *Space Rogue*, a fast-paced space shooter; navigate the challenging puzzles of *The Lost Files*; unravel the mystery in *The Clockwork Heart*; battle hordes of enemies in *Cyberia*; explore the depths of *The Caverns of Shadow*; and test your reflexes in *Raptor*. \n\nEach game boasts its own distinct style, gameplay mechanics, and captivating story, offering a diverse range of experiences. Relive the excitement of discovering hidden gems and the ingenuity of early Amiga developers.  A true celebration of shareware culture and a must-have for any Commodore Amiga gamer!"
    },
